# Static safety net for clean-URL canonicals.
# Functions/_middleware.js also performs these redirects (and handles
# duplicate-slash + tracking-param normalization), but these exact-match
# rules keep .html URLs out of the index even if Functions are unavailable.
# No wildcard here on purpose: a /*.html splat turns //path.html into a
# protocol-relative off-site redirect.

